{
  "Selects multiple items. Selected items appear as tags in the field, followed by a text input that searches the list. Items can come from memory or from a data source, and typed text can become a custom tag.": "",
  "`x-model` binds an array, and every change writes a new one. When you create the component with `new`, set the same properties programmatically.": "",
  "List options": "",
  "The list stays open during selection, shows selected items as checked, and can include a “Select all” row. Each option is a prop you can bind.": "",
  "With `dataSource`, typed text searches the data source (using its `searchFields`). In `'blocks'` mode, only the visible rows load, and tags for values on unloaded pages are looked up by key. `maxTags` keeps the field compact. This example has 5,000 customers.": "",
  "Custom tags": "",
  "With `acceptCustomValue`, pressing Enter adds text that matches no item as a tag. `customValue` transforms or rejects it, and `tagTemplate` customizes how a tag is drawn.": "",
  "Selects or deselects the highlighted item and keeps the list open. With `acceptCustomValue`, text that matches no item becomes a tag.": "",
  "Removes the last tag.": "",
  "Moves to the last tag.": "",
  "Moves between the tags. Right on the last tag, or End, returns to the input.": "",
  "Removes the tag.": "",
  "Closes the list. When closed, it clears the text, and then removes all tags with `clearButton`.": "",
  "Closes the list.": "",
  "The APG combobox with a multi-select listbox. The input has `role=\"combobox\"`, `aria-autocomplete=\"list\"`, `aria-expanded` and `aria-controls`, and the list has `aria-multiselectable`.": "",
  "A `role=\"list\"` of `role=\"listitem\"` elements. Each has a remove button named “Remove …” from `uiLocale`, and the “+3” tag lists the rest in its title.": "",
  "The label names the input, and help and error text describe it.": "",
  "The remove buttons (`removeItem`, “Remove {text}”), the “+3” tag (`moreItems`), “Select all”, the buttons and the list text come from `uiLocale.strings`.": "",
  "Added to the field. `data-open`, and `data-text` while text is typed, plus the TextBox field attributes.": "",
  "The tags, a tag (`data-loading` while its item is requested), its text and its remove button.": "",
  "The “+3” tag.": "“+3” etiketi.",
  "The text input and the buttons.": "Metin girişi ve düğmeler.",
  "The popup and the shared list.": "Popup ve ortak liste.",
  "Units: a tag (`more`: the \"+N\" tag, `loading`, `focus`, `hover`, `fixed`, `disabled`) and its text.": "Unit'ler: etiket (`more`: \"+N\" etiketi, `loading`, `focus`, `hover`, `fixed`, `disabled`) ve metni.",
  "Units: a tag's remove button (`hover`, `pressed`) and its glyph.": "Unit'ler: etiketin kaldırma düğmesi (`hover`, `pressed`) ve glyph'i.",
  "Units: the spacing around the tags in the box, the tag group, and the arrow that opens the list (`open`).": "",
  "The space between the tags and the field edge, and the minimum width of the input before it wraps to the next line.": "",
  "The list, the list box and the field.": "Liste, liste kutusu ve field.",
  "The values of the selected items. `x-model` binds them, and every change writes a new array.": "",
  "Same as ListBox. Groups apply to in-memory items.": "",
  "How and when typed text searches, as in ComboBox.": "",
  "Pressing Enter adds text that matches no item as a custom tag.": "",
  "The text": "",
  "Creates the value for typed text. Returning `null` rejects it.": "",
  "`true` (`false` with `acceptCustomValue`)": "`true` (`acceptCustomValue` ile `false`)",
  "Highlights the first match while typing, so Enter accepts it.": "",
  "Closes the list when an item is selected.": "",
  "The number of tags shown. The rest are counted in a “+3” tag. `0` shows all.": "",
  "The maximum number of selectable items. At the limit, the others cannot be selected. `0` means no limit.": "",
  "Adds a \"Select all\" row before the items.": "",
  "Removes selected items from the list (in-memory items only).": "",
  "Clicking the field opens the list.": "",
  "The arrow that opens all items, and the button that removes all tags.": "",
  "Customizes how a list item or a tag is drawn.": "",
  "The known items for the selected values. With a data source, the others are looked up by key.": "",
  "The text input.": "Metin girişi.",
  "Opens the list (returns `false` when disabled or read-only), or closes it.": "",
  "Removes all tags.": "",
  "Selects every item the list shows, up to `maxSelected` (with a data source, after their values load).": "",
  "Your items can be plain or reactive, and the box reads them as they are. After changing them in place, call `refresh()`. The tags, the open list and `selectedItems` update.": "",
  "Occurs when the list closes. The reason is `'escape'`, `'outside'`, `'focus'` or `'code'`.": ""
}
